WEBVTT

00:45.170 --> 00:46.337
Oh, things I hate?

00:47.797 --> 00:49.215
It's still Kook Yeon-su.

00:50.467 --> 00:52.927
And I can give you over ten reasons
why I hate her.

00:53.511 --> 00:57.223
First off, as I'm sure you know,
she can be so selfish.

00:57.307 --> 01:01.061
Yeon-su, you think we can see your notes
from our last class?

01:01.144 --> 01:03.063
I hear that
it's gonna be on the test.

01:05.148 --> 01:06.983
And you're the only one who took notes.

01:08.610 --> 01:10.653
Our test's tomorrow.
Can't you help us out?

01:10.737 --> 01:12.697
Besides,
we'll give it back right away.

01:24.000 --> 01:26.086
There, I don't have my notes anymore.

01:26.169 --> 01:27.670
Can you two go now?

01:27.754 --> 01:30.423
- I knew she was really stuck-up.
- Gosh.

01:31.049 --> 01:32.717
Man, she's so unbelievable.

01:37.180 --> 01:40.058
Hello, I'm Kook Yeon-su,
and I'm the team leader of Group 2.

01:40.141 --> 01:42.227
- 674 DAYS OF DATING
- And my team is…

01:43.478 --> 01:44.312
THE BROTHERS KARAMAZOV

01:44.395 --> 01:45.313
GROUP 2 KOOK YEON-SU

01:45.396 --> 01:47.315
…it's just me.

01:47.398 --> 01:49.067
Let me start the presentation.

01:49.150 --> 01:52.904
I will be making a presentation
on Book 12, or "A Judicial Error."

01:52.987 --> 01:54.656
And she doesn't have that much…

01:54.739 --> 01:57.450
I mean, she has no social skills at all.

01:57.534 --> 02:00.912
FEBRUARY 20, 2012
215 DAYS OF DATING

02:03.998 --> 02:05.458
Come on, let's drink more today.

02:05.542 --> 02:07.418
Don't worry, I'll take you home.
It'll be okay.

02:08.002 --> 02:10.171
And what made you think
you'll take me home?

02:10.255 --> 02:11.631
Well, I can drink better than you.

02:11.714 --> 02:14.425
- You can't be sure of that.
- Hey, come on, I'm a guy after all.

02:15.051 --> 02:15.927
Let's see, then.

02:17.137 --> 02:19.097
- What?
- Let's see who can drink more.

02:19.681 --> 02:21.266
She tries to win at everything.

02:21.349 --> 02:22.308
You really mean it?

02:23.393 --> 02:25.311
More drinks, please. Two beers.

02:28.648 --> 02:31.234
Hey, wait, look, we only came here
to have some fun, didn't we?

02:31.317 --> 02:32.152
Drink up.

02:37.490 --> 02:38.908
All right. You win, that's far enough.

02:41.786 --> 02:44.122
This competitive spirit of hers
is so useless.…

02:44.205 --> 02:46.666
You know, sometimes
you don't act like a senior.

02:46.749 --> 02:48.042
It's so ridiculous.

02:48.126 --> 02:51.087
Is that all you have to show off?
Being my senior? Is that all, huh?

02:51.171 --> 02:54.841
- Looks like we coddled you.
- "Coddled me"? When did you ever do that?

02:54.924 --> 02:57.594
What do you think I am? Your dog, huh?
What am I, your granddaughter?

02:57.677 --> 02:58.595
What the hell did you say?

02:58.678 --> 03:01.389
- I'm sorry. She's just a bit worked up.
- Why would you apologize? Move.

03:01.472 --> 03:03.183
- Why don't you say that again?
- She picks fights

03:03.266 --> 03:04.517
with nearly everyone.

03:04.601 --> 03:05.435
Move it.

03:06.644 --> 03:09.355
And don't get me started
on how stubborn she is.

03:10.481 --> 03:13.443
Have you lost your mind?
Why would I get a haircut like that?

03:13.526 --> 03:14.694
Why not? It looks all right.

03:14.777 --> 03:16.696
Do you really think
curly hair would suit me?

03:17.488 --> 03:20.074
- Why don't you look like this then?
- I'm sorry?

03:20.158 --> 03:21.201
Do his hair like this.

03:23.286 --> 03:26.331
His hair is too short.
I won't be able to do this hairstyle.

03:26.414 --> 03:28.082
No, it's all right.
Just make sure you do it.

03:28.166 --> 03:29.959
Hey, wait a second,
it's my hair, you know.

03:30.043 --> 03:32.378
Since yesterday, my ideal type
has been someone who can pull this off.

03:32.962 --> 03:33.796
I'm not doing this.

03:33.880 --> 03:34.964
Please, do what you can.

03:35.048 --> 03:36.049
FAITH HAIR SALON

03:39.969 --> 03:41.179
She's a psychopath

03:41.262 --> 03:44.599
who has to do whatever she wants,
no matter what I said.

03:45.516 --> 03:46.976
Can't you take the day off?

03:47.518 --> 03:50.772
I can't. It's not even
something that important anyway.

03:50.855 --> 03:53.149
Today's the last day
to see the cherry blossoms.

03:54.484 --> 03:56.277
This is our last chance.
It'll rain tomorrow.

03:56.361 --> 03:59.822
Why would we go all that way
just to see cherry blossoms?

04:00.448 --> 04:02.325
- And besides, there's next year.
- What?

04:02.408 --> 04:04.702
But that's what you said last year.
So why not go this year?

04:04.786 --> 04:07.830
And they're the prettiest
right before they start falling too.

04:07.914 --> 04:10.250
Why would you see flowers
that are about to fall?

04:10.333 --> 04:11.417
They don't even have a scent

04:11.501 --> 04:14.671
so they're just useless flowers
with bunched-up petals.

04:16.714 --> 04:20.677
And more than that,
she has no sense of romance at all.

04:21.719 --> 04:24.097
Hmm… So how many are left?

04:24.180 --> 04:25.848
- Hey, Yeon-su!
- Yes?

04:26.432 --> 04:29.227
- Hey, you said you'd eat lunch with me.
- Oh, right.

04:29.310 --> 04:32.188
Go eat with your friend. I have to go
to the library to fix my assignment.

04:32.272 --> 04:33.398
What?

04:33.481 --> 04:37.318
I came to school to have lunch with you
when I didn't even have class.

04:37.402 --> 04:39.070
Just eat with him.
This assignment's important.

04:39.654 --> 04:41.239
- Bye. I'll text you later.
- Hey.

04:41.322 --> 04:43.032
She always
has important stuff to do.

04:44.409 --> 04:46.494
I hate that she only thinks about herself.

04:46.577 --> 04:49.205
Is she your girlfriend? Oh, so that's her.

04:49.289 --> 04:51.040
She's famous in our school.

04:51.124 --> 04:53.918
She's pretty and all,
but her personality is…

04:54.002 --> 04:56.254
How can you date someone like her?

04:56.337 --> 04:59.424
Hey, do you even know
anything about Yeon-su?

04:59.507 --> 05:01.801
- What?
- Don't talk about her like that.

05:02.885 --> 05:04.095
You don't know anything.

05:06.055 --> 05:07.974
And here's another thing I hate…

05:08.599 --> 05:13.146
AUGUST 31, 2011
42 DAYS OF DATING

05:16.190 --> 05:17.650
- This…
- Mm-hmm.

05:17.734 --> 05:20.528
And this. They'll be on the test,
so go over them.

05:20.611 --> 05:22.864
And read through this
at least three times, okay?

05:22.947 --> 05:24.782
- Okay.
- I'm going to check.

05:27.702 --> 05:30.204
…that is
only I know one side of Yeon-su

05:31.831 --> 05:33.124
that nobody else knows.

05:33.624 --> 05:35.376
This is way more fun
than hanging out with Ung,

05:35.460 --> 05:37.295
I'll tell you that much.

05:38.713 --> 05:40.882
Ung isn't really
a fun guy to hang out with, right?

05:40.965 --> 05:42.592
He can be
a real snore sometimes.

05:42.675 --> 05:44.385
- "A snore"?
- Oh, we call boring people "snores."

05:44.886 --> 05:47.388
- Oh.
- Mom. I can hear everything.

05:48.097 --> 05:49.849
Mr. Snore has good ears, though.

05:49.932 --> 05:52.101
- Thank you so much, Mr. Snore.
- Of course.

05:52.935 --> 05:55.104
Let's eat before we continue.

05:55.188 --> 05:58.649
FEBRUARY 20, 2012
215 DAYS OF DATING

05:58.733 --> 06:00.109
Hop on.

06:09.243 --> 06:11.954
JUNE 4, 2012
320 DAYS OF DATING

06:15.333 --> 06:18.586
If you guys ever do that to Ung again,
I won't let it slide.

06:18.669 --> 06:21.756
Did you think I wouldn't notice you
ordering him around like an errand boy

06:21.839 --> 06:23.007
just because he's too nice?

06:23.591 --> 06:25.385
If you ever do that to him again,

06:25.468 --> 06:27.470
I'll show you how crazy I can really be.

06:29.305 --> 06:31.265
APRIL 1, 2013
621 DAYS OF DATING

06:37.188 --> 06:38.606
So why did you wanna see me?

06:39.524 --> 06:41.109
- Are you upset?
- Who? Me?

06:41.192 --> 06:44.862
No way. Why? Should I be, huh?

06:44.946 --> 06:46.614
We eat lunch
together all the time,

06:46.697 --> 06:48.658
- so why get upset over one meal?
- Well…

06:49.450 --> 06:52.954
- It's not exactly just one meal.
- Were you counting? That's so petty.

06:53.037 --> 06:55.915
Petty? Did you just call me petty?

06:57.375 --> 06:59.001
Hey. What's up?

07:12.765 --> 07:15.226
Here are the cherry blossoms.
We saw them.

07:17.186 --> 07:19.272
She showed
this side of her only to me.

07:20.606 --> 07:22.358
So I can't help but love her.

07:26.654 --> 07:27.947
And the ninth reason…

07:28.030 --> 07:29.574
She makes me love her… 

07:31.033 --> 07:34.078
but then just when I'm about
to love her even more…

07:35.955 --> 07:38.207
Why do we have to break up?

07:40.042 --> 07:42.753
When I think
I couldn't be any happier…

07:42.837 --> 07:44.839
You always break up with me first.

07:47.842 --> 07:51.262
…she would take me
to the highest of places first…

07:51.345 --> 07:54.891
Am I the easiest thing
to throw away of all the things you have?

07:58.561 --> 07:59.645
No.

08:01.481 --> 08:03.649
…and then she pushes me off.

08:04.484 --> 08:05.860
But you're the only one…

08:08.613 --> 08:10.198
that I can get rid of.

08:13.784 --> 08:15.828
She is so cruel.

09:07.713 --> 09:09.799
What if I had stopped behaving childishly?

09:12.593 --> 09:14.178
Would you have stayed with me?

09:20.935 --> 09:24.605
If you were being sincere back then,
tell me, what would you have done?

09:42.540 --> 09:46.419
10 THINGS I HATE ABOUT YOU

09:46.502 --> 09:51.799
EPISODE 3

09:56.053 --> 09:57.263
IT'S BEEN 10 YEARS
IT'S BLOWING UP AGAIN

09:57.346 --> 09:58.514
I'm a friend of Yeon-su.

09:58.598 --> 10:00.850
She does have a bad temper,
but she's kind.

10:00.933 --> 10:02.018
And to be honest,

10:02.101 --> 10:05.271
Choi Ung's the one who usually gets
a rise out of people and picks fights.

10:08.649 --> 10:10.985
What?
Choi Ung's just a bit weird.

10:11.068 --> 10:13.821
But he isn't the type to pick fights.
You're making it up.

10:16.365 --> 10:17.908
Do you even know the guy?

10:17.992 --> 10:20.620
"Just a bit weird"?
I think he's very weird.

10:20.703 --> 10:22.330
You're the one who's making things up.

10:23.581 --> 10:24.957
You're ridiculous.

10:25.041 --> 10:27.627
You'd be shocked
if you knew how he's doing lately.

10:27.710 --> 10:29.170
He's really successful, you know.

10:29.253 --> 10:31.464
He's a famous artist. Jeez.

10:32.089 --> 10:33.924
Hey, Ung, did you get some sleep?

10:34.008 --> 10:35.801
Is there a mosquito here?

10:37.219 --> 10:38.054
What's he doing, then?

10:38.137 --> 10:41.390
I'm sure he won't be as successful
as our smart Yeon-su.

10:44.602 --> 10:46.979
He was only
pretending to be dull.

10:47.063 --> 10:49.523
He's earning loads of money,
and he's a successful…

10:50.650 --> 10:52.276
Hey. What are you doing?

10:55.655 --> 10:58.491
But he might have
the brains of a mosquito.

10:58.574 --> 11:00.368
Hey…

11:01.327 --> 11:03.371
Eun-ho, how's my schedule looking?

11:04.830 --> 11:07.333
Nothing much except your exhibit. Why?

11:07.416 --> 11:08.501
- Really?
- Wait.

11:08.584 --> 11:10.294
Are you going to do the drawing show?

11:11.671 --> 11:14.882
Hey, why don't you get me some more work
to do? I've rested for too long.

11:14.965 --> 11:17.968
All of a sudden? You said
you wanted to take things slow.

11:18.052 --> 11:19.470
I need a distraction.

11:20.513 --> 11:22.014
- What?
- You're not

11:22.098 --> 11:24.725
going to stay cooped up in your room
working like before, are you?

11:24.809 --> 11:26.727
No, I won't. I won't do that again.

11:26.811 --> 11:28.270
But get me a lot of work.

11:28.354 --> 11:30.981
And I'll think about the drawing show.
It's still a maybe.

11:31.774 --> 11:32.692
All right then.

11:33.442 --> 11:35.569
But Ung, you have to get
plenty of sleep too.

11:36.195 --> 11:38.197
Your insomnia seems to have gotten worse.

11:42.535 --> 11:44.412
I guess it's still summer after all.

11:47.123 --> 11:49.208
YOU'D BE SHOCKED IF YOU KNEW
HOW HE'S DOING LATELY

11:50.876 --> 11:53.713
COMMENTS

11:56.090 --> 11:57.466
- What's up?
- Hmm?

11:58.509 --> 11:59.510
It's nothing.

12:03.305 --> 12:05.766
- Hey, Sol-i, I…
- Hmm?

12:07.601 --> 12:09.353
Never mind. Forget about it.

12:12.606 --> 12:15.901
You know, they say there are two ways
to make people go crazy.

12:15.985 --> 12:18.738
The first is to stop
in the middle of a sentence, and--

12:18.821 --> 12:20.156
I met Ung a while ago.

12:22.283 --> 12:24.952
Well, what I meant to say was,
I went to see him.

12:26.996 --> 12:29.498
You? Why? What for?

12:30.958 --> 12:32.710
- Wait, do you still--
- No way!

12:33.294 --> 12:35.212
There was someone I had to meet.

12:35.296 --> 12:37.465
It was supposed to be
for a project at work,

12:37.548 --> 12:38.924
and it turned out to be him.

12:39.008 --> 12:40.342
Funny, huh?

12:42.011 --> 12:43.471
Is this real?

12:43.554 --> 12:46.182
Why him, though? What's he doing now?

12:46.265 --> 12:48.350
Is he really successful, as people say?

12:48.434 --> 12:52.104
Well, I don't know how he lives,
but it looks like he did succeed.

12:52.938 --> 12:56.776
Wow. The guy who was
always lying down in the shade?

12:58.068 --> 13:00.571
Wow, life is full of surprises, isn't it?

13:03.574 --> 13:05.868
And so? How did it go?

13:06.869 --> 13:08.412
- What did?
- You know.

13:08.913 --> 13:10.831
How was it seeing him again?

13:11.582 --> 13:13.584
I really didn't feel anything.

13:13.667 --> 13:15.002
Hey.

13:15.085 --> 13:17.713
You're obviously lying.
I can tell, you know.

13:17.797 --> 13:20.007
I mean, when someone
so much as says the name of my ex,

13:20.090 --> 13:21.592
I can feel my heart drop to my feet.

13:21.675 --> 13:23.177
There's no way you felt nothing then.

13:23.260 --> 13:25.721
Don't you have way too many exes
to feel that, though?

13:25.805 --> 13:27.223
Oh, shut up. Anyway,

13:27.306 --> 13:29.391
being way too cool
about that isn't normal.

13:29.475 --> 13:31.393
Well, I really am cool about it.

13:31.477 --> 13:33.604
You know I don't hold grudges or anything.

13:41.821 --> 13:42.822
Yes, hello?

13:45.115 --> 13:46.200
Kim Ji-ung?

13:48.410 --> 13:50.204
What? What do you want me to do?

13:51.831 --> 13:54.208
Kook Yeon-su! You psycho!

13:57.628 --> 13:58.838
- I mean, look.
- Looking at that again?

13:58.921 --> 14:01.507
Go-oh was acting all quiet and nice.

14:01.590 --> 14:04.385
Kook Yeon-su! You psycho!

14:04.468 --> 14:06.554
He's cute I guess,
but he looks a bit dumb, huh?

14:06.637 --> 14:10.224
I know, right? So how can I resist
a cute, simple guy like him?

14:10.307 --> 14:11.517
COMMENTS
NJGODDESS

14:11.600 --> 14:13.894
That's a nice username you've got there.

14:13.978 --> 14:16.188
But why did he film something like that?

14:16.272 --> 14:18.649
I don't know.
But the guy sure is full of surprises.

14:19.233 --> 14:21.068
There's no way he can bore me.

14:21.151 --> 14:23.070
Where's Chi-seong?

14:23.153 --> 14:24.864
Oh, the CEO called him.

14:24.947 --> 14:27.491
Why? What's going on?

14:29.618 --> 14:31.245
What is it? Just tell me.

14:32.204 --> 14:34.790
I think it's because of your live video.
The one from yesterday.

14:35.875 --> 14:36.917
What about it?

14:37.001 --> 14:38.669
People who
don't even know you at all

14:39.253 --> 14:43.382
must've spread rumors about you
being depressed or on some hard drugs.

14:43.966 --> 14:45.342
There were some articles about it.

14:45.426 --> 14:48.637
If our CEO calls, you or Chi-seong
can just tell me right away.

14:48.721 --> 14:49.680
I'm gonna go now.

14:50.890 --> 14:51.807
Okay.

14:54.184 --> 14:55.603
Just turn it off.

14:55.686 --> 14:56.645
All right.

14:59.940 --> 15:01.734
- Wait, who is it?
- "Choi Un--"

15:03.777 --> 15:05.905
He called me.

15:05.988 --> 15:07.698
All right.
Let's get back to filming!

15:07.781 --> 15:09.783
Could I just have five min…
I mean, ten minutes?

15:12.119 --> 15:13.120
MR. CHOI UNG

15:17.124 --> 15:18.167
MR. CHOI UNG

15:19.376 --> 15:23.213
Hi, I'm sorry I answered a bit late,
but I was busy with my shoot.

15:23.297 --> 15:24.798
What did you wanna talk to me about?

15:25.799 --> 15:26.800
Hello, you there?

15:28.636 --> 15:29.762
Mr. Choi?

15:34.767 --> 15:36.560
MR. CHOI UNG

15:42.399 --> 15:43.233
Yes, hello?

15:43.317 --> 15:45.611
Why did you hang up so quickly?
That was so rude of you.

15:45.694 --> 15:48.948
- It was the first time you called me.
- Oh, did I? Sorry.

15:49.031 --> 15:51.575
Yes, and I can't believe
you hung up on me.

15:51.659 --> 15:53.619
So why did you call me?

15:53.702 --> 15:57.414
Well, that thing you asked for last time.
Drawing your buildings and…

15:57.498 --> 15:58.374
Oh, so you'll do it?

15:58.457 --> 16:00.459
Yes, but then…

16:01.043 --> 16:02.962
I've always drawn whatever I wanted to,

16:03.045 --> 16:05.255
I've never gotten
a request from anyone before.

16:05.339 --> 16:07.675
I think I'll be able to decide
after seeing your buildings.

16:07.758 --> 16:08.717
Sure, that's all right.

16:08.801 --> 16:11.261
Well then, why don't we go see them now?

16:11.845 --> 16:13.681
Well, I think I'll be busy today.

16:14.682 --> 16:16.308
And aren't you busy on your shoot too?

16:16.392 --> 16:18.185
- I am, but I'm not.
- What?

16:18.268 --> 16:20.938
Anyway, I'm busy, but I'm not too.
So tell me, when are you free?

16:21.981 --> 16:25.442
Oh, then I'll get back to you
after checking my sched.

16:25.526 --> 16:28.153
Shouldn't I be the one
telling you I'll check my schedule?

16:28.237 --> 16:30.447
I'm the celebrity here.
This kinda feels wrong.

16:30.531 --> 16:32.658
NJ! The director says
we have to start filming.

16:34.159 --> 16:37.037
Anyway, get back to me later.
And it'd better be real soon, got it?

16:37.121 --> 16:40.499
I hate it when people say
they'll contact me and take a long time.

16:41.083 --> 16:42.126
Bye, then.

16:42.209 --> 16:43.252
Alright.

16:44.086 --> 16:45.546
Holy mother of…

16:45.629 --> 16:47.715
You told me to get you more work.

16:47.798 --> 16:50.509
But then I catch you calling NJ yourself
when I'm your manager!

16:50.592 --> 16:51.635
Oh, jeez.

16:52.261 --> 16:54.430
Are you really pissed off about that?

16:54.513 --> 16:56.849
What? Seriously?

16:56.932 --> 16:58.809
Wow! You're unbelievable, man!

16:58.892 --> 17:00.978
I can't believe
you've really changed, Ung.

17:01.061 --> 17:02.730
Now that you're contacting NJ in person,

17:02.813 --> 17:04.648
you think you're
a hot shot artist or something?

17:04.732 --> 17:06.316
Is that how you see yourself now?

17:07.109 --> 17:09.486
Well, a word of advice,
you're gonna get a lot of hate.

17:09.570 --> 17:11.321
Both from me, and NJ's fans.

17:11.405 --> 17:14.366
Trust me when I say that
everyone's going to hate you now.

17:14.450 --> 17:15.909
Shut up, man.

17:16.869 --> 17:18.203
I've got a job for you to do.

17:19.413 --> 17:21.498
What is it? Are you going to meet NJ now?

17:21.582 --> 17:22.666
Should I get the car?

17:25.461 --> 17:27.254
I'm your manager,

17:27.880 --> 17:30.007
not your slave. You understand?

17:30.090 --> 17:32.176
Did you hear me?
Gosh, do I really have to do this?

17:32.259 --> 17:34.762
If you have a conscience,
you'd do what I tell you.

17:35.345 --> 17:38.098
Do I have to remind you
how many days you've stayed in my house?

17:38.182 --> 17:40.142
Seriously? Come on,
I can't believe you kept count.

17:40.225 --> 17:41.310
It was only a few days and--

17:41.393 --> 17:45.147
Hey, hey. You completely
emptied my fridge, remember?

17:45.230 --> 17:46.648
You're like locust on a farm.

17:46.732 --> 17:49.401
Whenever you visit, all the food
in my house magically disappears.

17:49.485 --> 17:51.403
You think I can file a claim for all that?

17:51.487 --> 17:53.447
I'll take care of the backyard then.

17:53.530 --> 17:56.617
Make sure you pull out all the weeds
and spread the cement over there.

17:56.700 --> 17:58.202
- Get a professional for that!
- Hey.

17:59.244 --> 18:01.163
The whiskey on my shelf disappeared too.

18:01.246 --> 18:03.832
You know, I happen to be
a cement professional too.

18:03.916 --> 18:04.875
Where should I start?

18:06.001 --> 18:07.086
Hey, Ji-ung.

18:14.343 --> 18:15.260
What's up?

18:15.761 --> 18:16.845
Let's film.

18:18.180 --> 18:20.349
- What?
- You have to do it.

18:21.767 --> 18:24.103
Please, stop annoying me.

18:25.104 --> 18:28.273
I need to do it. And that means so do you.

18:28.357 --> 18:29.733
What are you on about?

18:30.734 --> 18:33.445
- Did Dad tell you to film me?
- No, that's not it.

18:34.530 --> 18:36.073
You and Yeon-su.

18:37.324 --> 18:39.409
Just like before. A documentary.

18:50.295 --> 18:52.673
- No way.
- Why not?

18:52.756 --> 18:55.342
Are you crazy? Do you really think
I'd film that with her?

18:55.425 --> 18:58.137
He's right. Those two filming
another documentary together?

18:58.220 --> 19:00.931
It'll only take about a month,
and I'll film you myself.

19:01.014 --> 19:03.058
Why are you suddenly
trying to film all that again?

19:04.476 --> 19:08.564
Listen. As you know,
those videos are gaining popularity again.

19:08.647 --> 19:10.691
And we're thinking of filming
a youth documentary

19:10.774 --> 19:12.860
while they're all still trending.
And you're perfect for it.

19:12.943 --> 19:15.112
And most of all,
those videos are gonna be fun.

19:15.195 --> 19:16.029
It's awesome material.

19:16.113 --> 19:17.823
Yeah, very fun.
I'm really pumped for them.

19:17.906 --> 19:21.034
Guys. You know how I broke up with her
all those years ago.

19:21.118 --> 19:22.870
How can you ask me to do that now?

19:22.953 --> 19:24.454
Well, it's already been a long time.

19:24.538 --> 19:26.290
Unless you still have feelings for her?

19:26.373 --> 19:28.167
I don't have any feelings left.

19:28.250 --> 19:30.961
I don't even wanna see her again.
Better not to bother anymore.

19:31.044 --> 19:32.963
That means you do have feelings left.

19:34.882 --> 19:35.716
I'm not doing it.

19:38.302 --> 19:41.722
To be honest, I think this is gonna be
a very fun project to work on with you

19:42.222 --> 19:44.391
because of your past relationship.

19:44.474 --> 19:47.102
Why don't you watch those videos again?
There are so many comments,

19:47.186 --> 19:49.438
and you've become
so popular online because of it.

19:49.521 --> 19:51.773
Are you a sociopath?
Are you trying to use me?

19:51.857 --> 19:54.318
And is she even up for it?
I'm sure she isn't.

19:54.401 --> 19:55.944
I already talked to her.

19:57.613 --> 19:58.697
So what…

20:01.742 --> 20:02.743
What did she say?

20:03.327 --> 20:05.579
She started cursing at me,
so I had to back down a bit.

20:06.663 --> 20:08.999
At least we agree on something.

20:09.750 --> 20:12.044
Anyway, I'm still not doing it.

20:13.212 --> 20:14.963
That's just nonsense, man.

20:20.219 --> 20:22.930
Well, good luck
convincing him any further.

20:23.013 --> 20:24.348
He has an amazing offer,

20:24.431 --> 20:27.643
but he's hesitating because
Yeon-su's gonna be involved in it.

20:27.726 --> 20:28.977
Really?

20:29.061 --> 20:31.521
Then they can work together
and film together too, right?

20:31.605 --> 20:33.315
But what if they do that,

20:33.899 --> 20:36.401
and Ung starts getting feelings
for her again?

20:40.614 --> 20:44.034
He suddenly asked me
to get him a lot of work recently.

20:44.117 --> 20:45.535
I'm really worried for him.

20:47.329 --> 20:50.749
Maybe his feelings got complicated
after meeting her again like that.

20:52.125 --> 20:54.836
He can't go back to his old habits.

20:54.920 --> 20:56.129
You saw how he was then.

20:56.964 --> 20:58.048
It was crazy.

20:59.091 --> 21:00.467
Can you go through that again?

21:01.593 --> 21:02.803
Don't you remember?

21:05.389 --> 21:07.307
He was totally crazy

21:07.391 --> 21:09.643
the first few months after they broke up.

21:09.726 --> 21:11.311
5 YEARS AGO
JUNE 20, 2016

21:11.395 --> 21:12.562
Hey, Ung!

21:12.646 --> 21:15.607
Come on, man!
Let's go home. Get a grip already!

21:16.858 --> 21:17.943
Eun-ho.

21:19.278 --> 21:21.405
Do you know the thing
that Yeon-su hates the most?

21:22.281 --> 21:23.282
What?

21:24.700 --> 21:25.909
Getting drunk

21:27.452 --> 21:29.496
and making a scene late at night.

21:30.122 --> 21:31.498
Oh, my gosh.

21:33.000 --> 21:34.710
Jeez. You're driving me crazy.

21:34.793 --> 21:36.003
Ung, come on, it's late!

21:36.086 --> 21:36.920
Hey, where are you…

21:37.004 --> 21:40.090
Where are you going! Oh, darn it!

21:40.173 --> 21:42.301
He did everything
that Yeon-su hated back then…

21:42.384 --> 21:45.345
JUNE 22, 2016

21:47.264 --> 21:51.059
Hey, what is it this time?
What do you think you're doing?

21:51.143 --> 21:52.894
Another thing she really hates.

21:52.978 --> 21:55.063
Buying random stuff
while I'm totally plastered.

21:55.147 --> 21:57.524
Why would you nag me
when I'm buying stuff with my own money?

21:58.275 --> 22:00.736
…and ran around
like a crazy dog that night.

22:00.819 --> 22:01.987
JUNE 23, 2016

22:09.411 --> 22:10.370
Ung, wake up.

22:12.914 --> 22:14.791
- I don't wanna.
- You have an exam today.

22:14.875 --> 22:17.294
- Get up already.
- And another thing…

22:17.377 --> 22:18.795
What was that? What did you say?

22:18.879 --> 22:20.756
I'm not going to school

22:21.256 --> 22:23.717
not the day after you drink.

22:24.301 --> 22:25.594
What did you say?

22:25.677 --> 22:28.555
It's the thing
that Yeon-su hates the most.

22:29.473 --> 22:32.559
He was acting
like he had completely given up on life.

22:37.272 --> 22:41.276
AUGUST 3, 2016

22:45.614 --> 22:48.158
Weren't you the one
who told him about investing in stocks?

22:48.241 --> 22:51.370
I read on the internet
that stocks help you get over a breakup.

22:51.453 --> 22:53.622
Stocks during the day
and exercise at night

22:53.705 --> 22:55.082
leaves you no time to think.

22:56.500 --> 22:59.211
Oh, well,
I guess it was a bit effective.

23:03.215 --> 23:07.052
He was busy doing part-time jobs
making up for all the money he lost.

23:08.261 --> 23:11.014
One, two! All right, ready? Here we go!

23:11.098 --> 23:13.350
One, two! One, two!

23:14.309 --> 23:16.353
One, two! Two, two!

23:17.104 --> 23:19.022
Thanks to me,
he exercised a lot back then,

23:19.106 --> 23:21.400
he managed to stayed healthy.

23:21.483 --> 23:24.236
SEPTEMBER 29, 2016

23:35.414 --> 23:36.832
But, somehow despite that…

23:38.542 --> 23:40.377
he still seemed miserable,

23:40.460 --> 23:42.671
even when he was so busy.

23:44.464 --> 23:46.800
And after that,
the same patterns repeated several times.

23:46.883 --> 23:47.926
Mom.

23:48.009 --> 23:50.303
And then, that period finally began.

23:50.387 --> 23:51.555
He still hasn't come out yet?

23:55.517 --> 23:57.561
Choi Ung. You have to snap out of it.

23:57.644 --> 24:00.188
I'm counting to three,
then I'm just gonna break in.

24:00.272 --> 24:03.024
One, two, three!

24:23.336 --> 24:26.548
And so if we do put Yeon-su
right next to Ung once again…

24:28.550 --> 24:30.010
wouldn't that be too disastrous?

24:43.857 --> 24:45.984
Why does she live
such an exhausting life?

24:46.067 --> 24:48.320
Early birds just get tired earlier.

24:49.696 --> 24:50.989
Hurry up!

24:51.072 --> 24:52.407
Jeez.

24:52.491 --> 24:55.076
COMMENTS

24:55.160 --> 24:56.411
HE'S LIKE A SQUID

24:56.495 --> 24:57.787
UNG IS SO CUTE

25:00.499 --> 25:01.833
You see?

25:02.501 --> 25:04.503
It's nice seeing
compliments like that, right?

25:06.671 --> 25:08.965
Stop pretending to be asleep.
I already saw you.

25:15.931 --> 25:18.266
Anyway, why don't you think about it?

25:19.059 --> 25:22.145
Once you see all the videos,
you might just change your mind.

25:22.896 --> 25:23.813
I know that I did.

25:26.441 --> 25:27.400
And also…

25:30.862 --> 25:32.948
Never mind.

25:37.327 --> 25:38.662
You know…

25:39.996 --> 25:42.999
I think that Yeon-su hated the idea
more than you did.

25:46.253 --> 25:47.337
I'm just saying.

26:13.280 --> 26:14.948
TRENDING AGAIN
SCHOOL LIFE PLAYBOOK

26:27.669 --> 26:29.045
TRENDING AGAIN
SCHOOL LIFE PLAYBOOK

26:45.687 --> 26:48.982
SBC SPECIAL DOCUMENTARY
SCHOOL LIFE PLAYBOOK

26:49.065 --> 26:51.568
Choi Ung skipped study hall
and ran away again.

26:52.152 --> 26:54.112
I think he's trying
to ruin his own life.

26:54.195 --> 26:56.156
- Wow, I was so young.
- What can I do now?

26:56.239 --> 26:58.867
My skin used to be so elastic.

26:58.950 --> 27:00.118
Hurry up!

27:07.042 --> 27:09.711
Kook Yeon-su is really good
at exhausting people.

27:10.629 --> 27:13.006
Why does she have to live
such an exhausting life?

27:13.715 --> 27:16.259
I think even early birds
get tired earlier than her.

27:17.427 --> 27:20.764
That's right, I'm still living
an exhausting life right now.

27:23.099 --> 27:25.310
What will he be when he finally grows up?

27:26.102 --> 27:28.063
We can sleep all we want when we're dead.

27:28.563 --> 27:31.733
I'm sure he'll be lazy
for his entire life. You can count on it.

27:33.318 --> 27:36.237
But then he became
a famous artist after all.

27:38.281 --> 27:40.325
Life really is unfair sometimes.

28:10.563 --> 28:11.398
Oh?

28:13.024 --> 28:15.151
IT'S BEEN TEN YEARS ALREADY
I WONDER WHAT THEY'RE UP TO

28:15.235 --> 28:18.405
THIS IS WHAT BEING YOUNG IS ALL ABOUT

28:18.488 --> 28:21.241
THEY'RE SO YOUNG AND INNOCENT
LIKE SUMMERTIME

28:21.825 --> 28:23.243
I thought you were a ghost!

28:27.414 --> 28:30.792
"I guess you might say
this is what being young is all about."

28:31.292 --> 28:34.129
"They're so young and innocent,
like summertime."

28:34.212 --> 28:36.923
"It's something only the youth can have."

28:44.639 --> 28:45.724
Sorry.

28:48.601 --> 28:49.894
Hey! Hey!

28:50.729 --> 28:52.897
No! I said I'm sorry!

28:52.981 --> 28:54.023
Sorry!

28:54.107 --> 28:55.150
Hey.

29:01.072 --> 29:02.907
Hey, you! No running in the halls.

29:06.077 --> 29:07.704
Hey!

29:08.663 --> 29:10.915
Kook Yeon-su! You psycho!

29:21.134 --> 29:24.137
Oh, damn it.
Why did Ji-ung have to bring it up again?

29:31.519 --> 29:34.647
I won't even see him again.
That's all right, I guess.

29:41.821 --> 29:44.699
ARTIST NU-A

29:45.283 --> 29:46.785
But the problem is…

30:11.267 --> 30:12.727
I never once ran into him

30:12.811 --> 30:15.480
during the past five years,
but then on that day…

30:24.656 --> 30:26.825
Oh, my goodness.

30:43.550 --> 30:44.592
But, then…

30:45.718 --> 30:48.263
we keep running into each other.
It was so strange.

31:08.408 --> 31:10.869
Oh. Wait. I left my crutch!

31:11.369 --> 31:13.162
Just wait a minute, sir.

31:18.960 --> 31:20.962
Are you fucking kidding me?

31:21.546 --> 31:23.715
Maybe it could happen
once or twice.

31:28.469 --> 31:29.512
Excuse me.

31:32.807 --> 31:34.642
How is this even possible?

31:45.653 --> 31:47.238
Why the hell is this happening?

31:57.040 --> 31:59.417
Oh.

32:02.378 --> 32:04.631
Why in the world
is this happening to me?

32:09.886 --> 32:12.055
The paper bags here, they're really so…

32:18.519 --> 32:20.688
Hey, are you following me around?

32:20.772 --> 32:22.440
Why would you think something like that?

32:22.523 --> 32:24.275
Then what are you doing here
in my neighborhood, huh?

32:24.359 --> 32:26.486
Hey, this is near my house too, you know.

32:26.569 --> 32:28.154
But didn't you move?

32:28.237 --> 32:30.490
So? Do you even know where I live now?

32:34.285 --> 32:36.079
Hey. Does this even make sense?

32:36.162 --> 32:38.915
We never ran into each other
for the past five years.

32:38.998 --> 32:40.875
If it bothers you, then go somewhere else.

32:41.376 --> 32:42.543
What's that?

32:42.627 --> 32:44.545
You're the one who seems bothered.

32:44.629 --> 32:45.838
Maybe you should go somewhere else.

32:45.922 --> 32:48.383
And he's still
as childish as he ever was back then.

32:48.466 --> 32:50.510
What? Not me, why would I?

32:50.593 --> 32:53.596
You mean nothing to me.
Why the heck should I be bothered?

32:53.680 --> 32:57.100
How in the world is she this skilled
at annoying the hell out of me?

32:58.393 --> 33:02.021
You. You're lingering around me
because of that project, aren't you?

33:02.105 --> 33:03.940
And you're hoping
I'll change my mind about it.

33:04.023 --> 33:07.276
Oh, that? You don't need
to worry about it anymore.

33:07.360 --> 33:09.237
We're getting another artist instead.

33:10.029 --> 33:10.905
What? Who?

33:10.989 --> 33:13.074
There's this artist named Nu-a
who's pretty popular--

33:14.575 --> 33:17.286
Hey, Nu-a's just a total knockoff.

33:17.370 --> 33:19.831
You know he's always just
copying my drawing style.

33:19.914 --> 33:23.835
Well, I'm sure the public will find out
who's copying who very soon, I think.

33:23.918 --> 33:24.836
In fact,

33:24.919 --> 33:27.380
Nu-a's art is much better than yours.

33:27.964 --> 33:29.799
Hey, come on, don't say that.

33:30.383 --> 33:32.510
Hey, where are you going?
I'm not done here.

33:32.593 --> 33:36.180
Well, you seem to be bothered by me,
so I'm doing my best to avoid you.

33:36.264 --> 33:37.098
Hey, I'm not.

33:37.181 --> 33:40.810
And you really shouldn't work with Nu-a,
all right? You'll regret it later on.

33:40.893 --> 33:42.645
Just find some other artist to work with.

33:43.604 --> 33:45.773
Hey, just listen to me. Hey!

33:46.274 --> 33:48.443
Oh, oops. My bad.

33:48.526 --> 33:50.737
It went all the way over there.
So go get it.

33:51.612 --> 33:54.365
- Hey, Kook Yeon-su!
- I can be childish too, you know.

33:54.449 --> 33:56.200
I should've done this earlier.

33:56.284 --> 33:57.326
Feels great.

34:00.163 --> 34:02.665
- What?
- It was supposed to be Go-oh.

34:02.749 --> 34:06.461
He said he'll cancel the contract
if you're working with Nu-a instead.

34:08.463 --> 34:09.547
You said you found Go-oh.

34:09.630 --> 34:11.549
Why are you changing
the artist all of a sudden?

34:13.468 --> 34:15.845
Well, I know that Nu-a is also
a popular artist these days.

34:16.429 --> 34:18.431
And I think the art style
suits Soen Shop very well.

34:18.514 --> 34:20.349
And Nu-a seemed
to want to work with us too.

34:20.433 --> 34:23.102
Yes, I know, but he said
he only wants Go-oh.

34:23.603 --> 34:24.937
Why? Did he ask for too much money?

34:25.021 --> 34:26.689
Was his price too steep?

34:26.773 --> 34:28.775
Well, you see, it's…

34:28.858 --> 34:31.694
Yeon-su. The plan was going well already.
What's going on?

34:31.778 --> 34:35.031
You know how important
this project is for our company, right?

34:35.114 --> 34:36.908
Everyone is relying on you for this.

34:40.703 --> 34:44.165
Darn it. Well,
if he wants more than our budget,

34:44.248 --> 34:45.958
then write up a new estimate for him.

34:46.042 --> 34:47.877
I'll try to make it work,
but just get it done.

35:11.484 --> 35:14.112
Why does everything
have to be messed up like this?

35:20.201 --> 35:24.247
Ever since Choi Ung popped up again,
things have been going downhill.

35:29.585 --> 35:30.711
Goodbye, sir.

35:30.795 --> 35:32.380
Mm. All right. Take care.

35:35.258 --> 35:37.593
Where is this jerk?

35:37.677 --> 35:38.845
I haven't seen him all day.

35:38.928 --> 35:41.389
Where in the world did that guy
run off to anyway?

35:41.472 --> 35:44.058
He said he's trying to cast
the people from the documentary.

35:45.393 --> 35:46.352
Is that so?

35:46.435 --> 35:47.937
Well, did he have any luck?

35:48.855 --> 35:50.439
He never reports his progress to me.

35:51.566 --> 35:53.985
He never fails
when he sets his mind on something.

35:54.068 --> 35:55.236
I guess.

35:55.736 --> 35:57.029
That's why I can't scold him.

35:57.989 --> 35:59.115
But why did he…

36:00.241 --> 36:03.452
suddenly decide to do the documentary
in the first place?

36:03.536 --> 36:06.247
He spent days browsing through old videos.

36:06.330 --> 36:08.416
I guess he got interested
after doing that.

36:09.542 --> 36:10.668
He watched everything?

36:15.214 --> 36:16.382
Hey, you know what?

36:17.091 --> 36:18.301
I did a good job of filming.

36:18.384 --> 36:21.179
There are so many fun
behind the scene cuts on those clips.

36:22.346 --> 36:26.058
So you say he watched everything, huh?
That's kind of adorable.

36:26.142 --> 36:28.311
Come to think of it,
I hadn't thought of it before,

36:28.394 --> 36:30.688
Ji-ung was pretty cute
when he was in high school.

36:31.480 --> 36:32.982
I remember when he appeared on the screen,

36:33.691 --> 36:35.151
I recall he would freeze.

36:37.528 --> 36:41.449
By the way, why do you always
ask me about Ji-ung anyway?

36:42.575 --> 36:43.618
What?

36:43.701 --> 36:46.537
Everyone keeps asking me
about Ji-ung, not just you.

36:46.621 --> 36:48.998
Oh. Well, I mean…

36:51.125 --> 36:52.668
Because you know the most about him.

36:52.752 --> 36:54.545
- Don't you?
- What?

36:54.629 --> 36:57.506
Everyone always asks you first
when they're looking for Ji-ung.

36:57.590 --> 36:59.425
Didn't you notice that happening?

37:01.510 --> 37:03.429
- Why though?
- It's obvious.

37:23.032 --> 37:25.534
Should I tell you
what Ji-ung was like in high school?

37:26.577 --> 37:29.622
- Well, if you're not curious…
- You can tell me if you're bored instead.

37:36.796 --> 37:38.256
Looking at Ji-ung…

37:41.467 --> 37:44.804
always reminds me
of my old high school days.

37:44.887 --> 37:47.306
So I have to tell you
about my high school days first.

37:47.390 --> 37:50.476
Why did Ms. Kook suddenly
get off work so early?

37:50.559 --> 37:53.396
She probably went to Go-oh
to talk about our new project.

37:53.479 --> 37:55.523
Well, at least,
we got to get off work early.

37:55.606 --> 37:57.066
Well then, you guys wanna get drinks?

37:57.149 --> 37:59.819
Oh, no. I'm on a diet right now. Mm.

38:00.778 --> 38:01.779
What?

38:03.281 --> 38:05.825
No way. hey, isn't that Ms. Kook?

38:06.617 --> 38:07.910
Oh!

38:09.620 --> 38:12.331
Don't tell me
she got off early to go on a date?

38:12.415 --> 38:15.084
Wow, they look
so good together, don't they?

38:15.167 --> 38:17.211
I can't believe
she's actually dating.

38:17.295 --> 38:18.587
Wait, there's no way.

38:19.297 --> 38:21.882
- That's impossible.
- What's so impossible about it?

38:22.717 --> 38:23.843
To be honest,

38:24.552 --> 38:27.513
- I was shipping her with someone else.
- What do you mean by that?

38:27.596 --> 38:30.349
Is she going somewhere?
What's going on? Come on, tell us.

38:30.433 --> 38:33.144
No, that's not what I meant, you guys.

38:33.227 --> 38:35.521
I mean, I thought that
she would end up dating

38:36.105 --> 38:37.898
Mr. Jang over anybody else.

38:37.982 --> 38:39.567
What? Her and Mr. Jang?

38:39.650 --> 38:40.943
What are you trying to say?

38:41.027 --> 38:42.903
I have a bit of a sixth sense

38:42.987 --> 38:44.822
when it comes
to stuff like this, you know.

38:44.905 --> 38:47.867
Something's going on
between Ms. Kook and Mr. Jang.

38:47.950 --> 38:50.244
It's so juicy, I can almost smell it.

38:50.328 --> 38:52.121
And they do look good together,
don't they?

38:52.204 --> 38:53.497
Come on, how can you say that?

38:53.581 --> 38:54.999
They've always been
at each other's throats.

38:55.082 --> 38:57.251
But that's how romance begins,
you crazy fools.

38:57.335 --> 38:58.919
- Oh, you're so clueless.
- No, I'm not.

38:59.003 --> 39:00.880
Wait a sec, haven't you been proven wrong?

39:00.963 --> 39:02.381
We just saw her with that guy.

39:02.882 --> 39:05.134
Oh, well, I don't think
we can know for sure yet.

39:05.634 --> 39:06.886
I have to keep watching them.

39:06.969 --> 39:09.221
Then how about we discuss all that

39:09.305 --> 39:12.099
over some thin pork belly
on a hot grill then?

39:12.183 --> 39:14.894
Didn't you hear what I said?
I'm on a diet right now.

39:14.977 --> 39:18.189
Didn't you hear what I said?
Thin pork belly on a hot grill.

39:20.691 --> 39:22.526
Well, I guess thin slices are okay.

39:22.610 --> 39:23.486
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

39:23.569 --> 39:26.614
Come on.

39:28.699 --> 39:30.785
I think you're just
wasting your time with this.

39:30.868 --> 39:32.203
I told you I won't do it.

39:32.286 --> 39:33.788
Still, you have to give me a reason.

39:33.871 --> 39:35.122
Don't you know already?

39:35.206 --> 39:37.166
It's Choi Ung.
Why would I do any of that with him?

39:37.750 --> 39:40.503
Well, why not?
There's nothing between you two anyway.

39:41.087 --> 39:42.922
You don't have
lingering feelings left, do you?

39:43.714 --> 39:45.508
Did you come here
just to make jokes with me?

39:45.591 --> 39:48.469
That childish method won't work on me.
So try that on Choi Ung.

39:50.638 --> 39:53.891
- I knew it wouldn't work.
- Then why did you come all the way here?

39:53.974 --> 39:55.893
It's still my job
to get you on board, that's why.

39:56.644 --> 39:58.104
If that method doesn't work,

39:59.105 --> 40:00.314
I'll have to use another approach.

40:00.898 --> 40:02.608
Fine. I'm sure I won't change my mind,

40:02.691 --> 40:05.111
but I'll listen
to what you have to say. Go on then.

40:10.241 --> 40:11.534
Why do you think

40:11.617 --> 40:14.787
people decide to star in a documentary
when it's all about themselves?

40:16.831 --> 40:18.749
Oh. Well…

40:19.375 --> 40:21.252
To promote their businesses, or maybe…

40:21.335 --> 40:24.171
Oh, yeah? I'm sure most of them
don't have businesses to promote.

40:25.381 --> 40:26.799
For the pay, then.

40:26.882 --> 40:29.385
You get paid for them.
That's why I did it back then.

40:29.468 --> 40:31.303
Then you should know
it's not that huge of a sum, right?

40:31.387 --> 40:33.347
Are you telling me to come up
with a reason?

40:33.848 --> 40:35.641
I'm always honest when I'm casting people.

40:35.724 --> 40:38.561
"There's only one thing
we can give to you.

40:38.644 --> 40:40.187
But we know it'll be worth it.

40:41.605 --> 40:44.942
We are recording
a fraction of your life just for you."

40:47.278 --> 40:50.489
When I say this, most people
seem to think that it's no big deal

40:50.573 --> 40:52.491
and what I do
doesn't really matter at all.

40:52.575 --> 40:53.576
But then…

40:54.994 --> 40:56.579
after we finish filming them,

40:56.662 --> 40:58.456
and when they finally
see the video themselves,

40:58.539 --> 41:00.666
then they realize what it really meant.

41:02.293 --> 41:03.502
They get to realize

41:03.586 --> 41:07.715
how precious it is to be able to
capture and store a moment in their lives.

41:09.300 --> 41:12.261
And that's why it's actually easier for me
to convince you specifically

41:12.344 --> 41:14.680
to film an interview
than it is with others.

41:16.849 --> 41:18.767
You've had those records before, right?

41:20.811 --> 41:22.646
Then you'll know what will fit best.

41:22.730 --> 41:25.274
You have a part of the summer
when you were still 19.

41:25.357 --> 41:26.650
Now tell me the truth.

41:26.734 --> 41:28.319
Does that really mean nothing to you?

41:32.823 --> 41:33.866
I guess…

41:34.783 --> 41:36.202
Did you see the other videos?

41:38.037 --> 41:38.913
No.

41:38.996 --> 41:41.332
You and Ung are not so different
from each other, you know?

41:42.208 --> 41:44.960
Why are you both
so hesitant to watch those videos?

41:45.753 --> 41:47.338
To be honest, way back then

41:47.922 --> 41:50.007
I really thought
that all of this meant nothing.

41:50.090 --> 41:52.551
But when I looked through the videos,
I had a realization

41:52.635 --> 41:54.845
you and Ung, the two of you

41:54.929 --> 41:57.306
are the most suited
for our youth special documentary.

42:01.268 --> 42:02.561
You're good with words, Ji-ung.

42:04.271 --> 42:05.272
Respect.

42:06.106 --> 42:08.651
But sorry, you've failed to convince me.
So I won't do it.

42:16.158 --> 42:17.076
Oh, well.

42:18.661 --> 42:19.662
What?

42:22.122 --> 42:24.124
Is that it?

42:24.208 --> 42:26.001
I have never failed at casting people.

42:27.586 --> 42:29.421
That means I have another plan.

42:30.422 --> 42:33.175
That makes me feel uneasy.

42:34.385 --> 42:37.888
Will you tell me
if I ask you what you're doing?

42:41.559 --> 42:43.060
It's about Ung…

42:47.147 --> 42:48.774
I can't let her work with Nu-a.

42:48.857 --> 42:51.694
There, you see? You should have
thanked her and accepted her offer

42:51.777 --> 42:54.446
when she wanted to work with you then.
What were you thinking, huh?

42:54.530 --> 42:56.407
Why would I thank you? I'm not crazy.

42:56.490 --> 42:59.618
Grown-ups should know how to keep
their personal life separate from work.

43:00.160 --> 43:03.330
Everyone's nagging me about that
as if everyone can do it so well.

43:03.414 --> 43:06.250
Wow, you're such a loser. Unbelievable.

43:07.376 --> 43:09.128
Ung, be honest with me.

43:09.211 --> 43:11.672
You want Yeon-su to come
and beg you to work with her, don't you?

43:11.755 --> 43:13.841
You're doing this
because you wanna see her begging you,

43:13.924 --> 43:16.594
even if this is all
just because of work, am I right?

43:18.554 --> 43:20.723
- She'll never do that.
- See? That's what I mean!

43:20.806 --> 43:23.267
If you know that,
why are you even doing all of this?

43:23.350 --> 43:26.061
Honestly, you sound like the one
picking fights with her.

43:26.645 --> 43:28.147
It's so annoying, man.

43:28.230 --> 43:30.983
Pretending she doesn't feel anything,
that she doesn't care.

43:31.066 --> 43:32.610
What? Not me, why would I?

43:32.693 --> 43:35.070
You mean nothing to me.
Why the heck should I be bothered?

43:35.154 --> 43:36.864
She was always like that.

43:36.947 --> 43:39.074
Oh, that? You don't need
to worry about it anymore.

43:39.158 --> 43:40.576
We're getting another artist instead.

43:40.659 --> 43:43.287
There's this artist named Nu-a
who's pretty popular…

43:43.370 --> 43:45.539
She's so selfish
and always so full of herself.

43:45.623 --> 43:46.874
And yet, she still won.

43:48.500 --> 43:51.003
Just go and say that you agree,
and you'll do the project.

43:51.086 --> 43:54.256
If you wanna do it, of course they still
have to decide to do it with you or not.

43:54.340 --> 43:57.134
Hey, wait a second, why would I ever
do something that would help her?

43:57.676 --> 43:59.928
I should be doing stuff
that she hates instead.

44:08.854 --> 44:10.689
I just had an idea.

44:21.575 --> 44:24.036
What's that face?
I have a bad feeling about this.

44:25.621 --> 44:26.830
That's right.

44:27.414 --> 44:30.084
I should be doing stuff that she hates.

44:30.167 --> 44:32.836
That'll be a great way
to win over Kook Yeon-su.

44:34.463 --> 44:36.965
Uh, I don't know what you're thinking,
but I'm gonna stop you right there.

44:37.049 --> 44:38.008
Hey, Eun-ho.

44:39.176 --> 44:40.928
I have some work for you to do.

44:41.011 --> 44:42.846
What? I already spread all that cement.

44:43.347 --> 44:45.891
Not that. I meant,
I want you to work as my manager.

44:45.974 --> 44:48.060
Your what? NJ?

44:49.186 --> 44:52.106
Is this work for NJ?
Can I really look forward to it this time?

45:00.614 --> 45:03.325
Why didn't I think of this before?

45:26.890 --> 45:30.644
He's a total player. I'm sure of it.

45:35.357 --> 45:38.152
Why do guys always say
that they'll contact you, but never do so?

45:38.736 --> 45:41.572
He said he would,
he said that he would contact me first

45:41.655 --> 45:43.490
so that I could even contact him.

45:43.574 --> 45:46.076
But it's been days already,
and he still hasn't contacted me.

45:46.160 --> 45:49.455
Why in the world is he acting like this?
He even told me he was my fan…

45:53.041 --> 45:55.127
He said he liked me when we first met.

45:55.210 --> 45:58.255
But why isn't he contacting me?
What's going on?

46:01.759 --> 46:03.719
Don't you know the answer?
He's not into you.

46:03.802 --> 46:05.429
I don't think
he's interested in you.

46:05.512 --> 46:07.514
He's keeping you
on the hook, that's all.

46:07.598 --> 46:09.725
He could just be
pretty cautious maybe.

46:28.911 --> 46:32.956
CHOI UNG

46:41.507 --> 46:43.133
Hi. My name is Gu Eun-ho.

46:45.219 --> 46:47.221
GU EUN-HO

46:47.304 --> 46:50.516
QUEENJ_EUNHOW

46:59.358 --> 47:00.526
STAY HEALTHY

47:04.822 --> 47:07.199
WENT DRINKING WITH UNG

47:07.282 --> 47:09.076
He's drinking and having fun,

47:09.660 --> 47:12.079
but not making the effort
to even try calling me.

47:15.874 --> 47:16.708
No, I can't.

47:16.792 --> 47:19.044
I can't press "like" on
a non-celebrity's account.

47:46.113 --> 47:48.907
All right, all right, man, I get it.

47:48.991 --> 47:52.870
Yeah. Yes, I'm totally safe, man. Okay?

47:53.537 --> 47:55.581
Yeah, and I'm almost home!

47:55.664 --> 47:56.582
Yeah.

47:57.583 --> 47:58.667
All right.

48:01.420 --> 48:03.714
Gosh, it sure has been a while.

48:10.012 --> 48:11.305
Wait a sec.

48:19.688 --> 48:20.898
I knew it.

48:21.815 --> 48:23.483
It's Kook Yeon-su again.

48:25.402 --> 48:27.529
Did everyone else
in the neighborhood disappear?

48:27.613 --> 48:28.989
Why is it always her?

48:38.165 --> 48:39.124
Were you drinking again?

48:50.427 --> 48:51.762
Okay. Just go back home already.

48:52.846 --> 48:55.307
Ten reasons why I hate Kook Yeon-su.

48:56.224 --> 48:58.352
Am I the easiest thing to throw away

48:59.227 --> 49:00.312
of all the things you have?

49:02.356 --> 49:03.357
No.

49:04.399 --> 49:05.901
But you're the only one…

49:07.069 --> 49:08.278
that I can get rid of.

49:11.782 --> 49:13.033
What's the reason?

49:16.286 --> 49:17.746
What's your reason?

49:19.122 --> 49:20.958
Why do we have to break up?

50:00.789 --> 50:02.833
The tenth and the last reason

50:03.834 --> 50:08.380
is because she erased me
from her life so easily.

50:22.477 --> 50:23.812
Good morning, everyone.

50:23.895 --> 50:25.522
- Good morning.
- Oh, good morning, Ms. Kook!

50:26.314 --> 50:28.108
You all seem
to be in a good mood.

50:28.191 --> 50:30.944
Well, you see, huh,
you gave us an amazing present,

50:31.028 --> 50:32.154
of course, we'd be happy.

50:32.237 --> 50:33.947
- What are you talking about?
- Oh, come on, now.

50:34.031 --> 50:36.908
Didn't you stay quiet all this time
just to surprise us?

50:36.992 --> 50:38.326
I don't know what you're talking about.

50:38.410 --> 50:40.620
Someone from
Go-oh's agency dropped by here.

50:40.704 --> 50:43.290
And we heard that
you were friends with Go-oh.

50:43.373 --> 50:45.333
So why didn't you tell us about it?

50:45.417 --> 50:47.711
Wait. Who dropped by earlier?

50:47.794 --> 50:51.089
His manager came to say
he'll work on the Soen Shop project.

50:51.757 --> 50:53.467
Choi Ung, uh, no, I mean,

50:54.051 --> 50:55.802
Go-oh really said
that he'd do it, for real?

50:55.886 --> 50:59.264
Yes. He said that he'd do it
because you were going to help him

50:59.347 --> 51:00.807
with something as well.

51:01.933 --> 51:04.269
- He said I would?
- "I would"?

51:05.812 --> 51:07.022
Come on, quit playing.

51:07.522 --> 51:10.317
Who knew you would have
such connections, Yeon-su?

51:10.400 --> 51:12.903
I already told Soen Shop
about the good news too.

51:13.612 --> 51:16.281
No way. No, that's impossible.

51:16.364 --> 51:19.951
I… could you please excuse me?
I need to meet someone.

51:20.035 --> 51:21.411
I'll be back in a bit.

51:21.995 --> 51:22.913
What's up?

51:31.421 --> 51:33.799
Why did you send me
to get the contract so early?

51:33.882 --> 51:35.258
I thought it was about NJ.

51:36.384 --> 51:37.761
You did as I told you?

51:37.844 --> 51:38.762
Yes.

51:39.429 --> 51:40.847
And did you meet Yeon-su?

51:40.931 --> 51:42.349
No, she wasn't there.

51:43.225 --> 51:44.601
Is that so?

51:46.103 --> 51:47.979
It's going to get noisy here soon.

51:48.647 --> 51:49.815
I suggest you stay away.

51:50.649 --> 51:51.858
Why?

51:51.942 --> 51:54.111
It's going to be a mess here soon.

51:55.654 --> 51:56.905
Hmm?

51:56.988 --> 52:01.118
One, ten, hundred, thousand… 17,867?

52:01.201 --> 52:06.081
Why did 17,867 people like
the photo I posted of us eating meat?

52:06.164 --> 52:07.082
What are you talking about?

52:16.883 --> 52:18.051
Oh, come on.

52:19.344 --> 52:20.220
NJ.

52:21.138 --> 52:23.723
NJ liked my photo of us eating!

52:23.807 --> 52:25.100
What?

52:26.101 --> 52:27.769
Look.

52:27.853 --> 52:28.937
NJ!

52:32.149 --> 52:33.942
I can't believe
NJ liked my photo!

52:34.734 --> 52:37.028
Oh, God, NJ really liked my photo!

52:40.532 --> 52:41.992
So about Ung…

52:43.118 --> 52:44.536
When we were about nine,

52:44.619 --> 52:46.955
I always teased him
and ran away back in those days.

52:47.664 --> 52:48.665
So what about it?

52:48.748 --> 52:51.126
I think he just wanted to get back at me.

52:51.209 --> 52:53.670
One day, he brought
some shaved ice to eat together.

52:54.296 --> 52:55.964
So I gladly ate it up.

52:56.047 --> 52:59.718
Even if I had a terrible allergy
to the peaches added to it.

53:00.510 --> 53:02.846
But wait,
isn't he allergic to them as well?

53:02.929 --> 53:04.431
That crazy jerk.

53:04.514 --> 53:07.225
You know, he gladly ate peaches
with me just to get revenge.

53:07.309 --> 53:09.269
Unbelievable.

53:09.352 --> 53:10.812
So then what happened to you guys?

53:11.396 --> 53:14.566
We both got sent
to the emergency room with puffy faces,

53:14.649 --> 53:18.904
and he even smirked at me
from the bed right across mine.

53:19.529 --> 53:21.781
So that's when I decided
to stop bullying him.

53:22.616 --> 53:24.534
So why are you telling me all of this?

53:25.911 --> 53:30.540
Well, Choi Ung, um, he's the type
who's willing to endure his own pain,

53:30.624 --> 53:33.543
if it means he can make others suffer
just as badly, if not worse.

53:33.627 --> 53:37.172
And I'm sure that
you'll realize what I mean soon.

53:38.632 --> 53:40.175
No, there's no way.

53:40.258 --> 53:42.802
Would Choi Ung
really be that crazy like he said?

53:45.096 --> 53:47.474
Well, that's what I thought at first,

53:47.557 --> 53:50.060
but then seeing his face
all but confirmed it.

53:51.770 --> 53:53.021
He really is crazy.

53:54.606 --> 53:56.107
What do you mean?

53:57.359 --> 53:59.653
Did you agree to work
on our project just because…

54:00.237 --> 54:02.489
Hmm. Because you'll be helping me too.

54:04.157 --> 54:06.326
And by helping you, do you mean that…

54:06.409 --> 54:09.079
I wanna film that documentary with you.

54:09.162 --> 54:10.163
Again.

54:10.247 --> 54:12.749
This may not be different
from when I ate those peaches.

54:12.832 --> 54:14.709
I guess we can
chalk that up to my condition.

54:14.793 --> 54:15.877
Let's film it together.

54:16.544 --> 54:19.047
The documentary I mean. Just for a month.

54:21.383 --> 54:22.550
That's it.

54:24.261 --> 54:25.345
Choi Ung!

54:26.805 --> 54:28.765
If Kook Yeon-su hates it this much,

54:29.391 --> 54:31.059
then I can take it.

54:38.358 --> 54:39.276
EPILOGUE

54:40.986 --> 54:42.779
This is so ridiculous.

54:43.363 --> 54:45.323
Does he still really hate me that much?

54:46.449 --> 54:49.995
Hmm. Well, I guess for me…

54:50.704 --> 54:51.955
I don't really care.

54:53.081 --> 54:55.625
You know, I'd like to think
I'm kind of a cool person.

54:55.709 --> 54:57.627
I don't really
hold grudges against people.

54:57.711 --> 54:58.586
I mean it.

55:00.964 --> 55:03.675
FIVE YEARS AGO
AFTER THE BREAKUP

55:26.656 --> 55:28.450
- Here, please enjoy.
- Thank you so much.

55:28.533 --> 55:31.036
- Oh, you can leave that here instead.
- Yeah, thank you.

55:32.412 --> 55:34.122
Oh.

55:34.205 --> 55:35.623
Hi, welcome.

55:35.707 --> 55:37.751
- Yeah, I'd like to order this.
- Yes.

55:48.636 --> 55:50.472
If you have something to say,

55:50.555 --> 55:52.349
stop staring at me and just say it.

55:56.895 --> 55:58.396
Are you really feeling okay?

56:00.774 --> 56:02.650
- What's that?
- Sorry?

56:12.577 --> 56:14.079
You broke up with Ung, didn't you?

56:15.288 --> 56:17.832
And you two were dating
for such a long time.

56:19.084 --> 56:22.629
Hey, come on.
You can be honest with me, you know that.

56:22.712 --> 56:25.382
Just tell me if you're feeling any pain.

56:25.465 --> 56:28.843
It's scarier seeing you act like this.
As if nothing's wrong.

56:28.927 --> 56:30.428
It's so hard to watch this.

56:30.512 --> 56:32.389
Don't worry about it too much.

56:34.432 --> 56:35.975
But are you really okay?

56:37.310 --> 56:38.228
Hmm.

56:38.728 --> 56:40.105
I swear, I'm really okay.

56:49.948 --> 56:51.658
Hey, grandma, I'm home.

58:18.745 --> 58:20.413
I tell you, I'm really fine.

58:21.247 --> 58:22.332
Yes, it's true.

58:25.418 --> 58:31.549
10 THINGS I HATE ABOUT YOU

58:57.951 --> 58:59.577
Don't make me laugh.

58:59.661 --> 59:01.287
Is that what he said?

59:02.372 --> 59:05.625
The minor details may be different,
but to tell you the truth…

59:06.501 --> 59:09.629
It was on that day
when everything went haywire.

59:09.712 --> 59:10.630
Hey.

59:10.713 --> 59:13.383
Since you're pretty childish
and act like you're so pathetic…

59:16.010 --> 59:17.971
I believe you.

59:19.222 --> 59:20.974
You also ruined my life.

59:21.057 --> 59:22.559
You wreaked havoc.
